      "writtenOn": "2017-09-27T19:16:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Same issue as before. You\u0027re assuming that begin \u003c\u003d buffer.limit, which is not guaranteed to be the case. The safe pattern is:\n  b.position(0);\n  b.limit(end);\n  b.position(begin);\nOR\n  b.limit(b.capacity());\n  b.position(begin);\n  b.limit(end);\n\nThe reason this works is that it\u0027s always safe to set position to 0 or set limit to capacity.",
      "revId": "51531adf0a400148fc63b2d91542188299a76021",
